type: software
title: "ojas: a deterministic Rust deep learning engine"
abstract: >-
  ojas is a Rust deep learning engine with bit-identical reductions under its
  Exact numerics, explicit memory budgets, no silent CPU fallback from a GPU
  backend, reverse-mode autodiff, and CPU, Apple Silicon Metal and wgpu
  backends, driven in process from Go.
